{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915610/extras/f3a6dc4c8c524f24cb3293aa24b330b7.avif?t=1765425123\" width=1232 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Meow Palace!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy, laid-back game that blends idle play, bonding, and cultural discovery. Slip into the paws of a stray kitty who\u2019s wandered into the Forbidden City. With the help of palace cats, you\u2019ll learn new tricks, collect treasures, unlock stories, and experience the whimsical life of a royal feline.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915610/extras/fab7bd287cfc19d05b92f4a1dccda04a.avif?t=1765425123\" width=780 height=130 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your tale begins the moment a little wanderer pads through the gates of the Forbidden City.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From whiskers to tail, from eye color to fur pattern, you can customize every detail to create your one-of-a-kind \u201cPalace Meow.\u201d Guided by the resident cats, you\u2019ll settle into court life, make friends, take on quests, and uncover the hidden stories tucked away in this legendary palace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915610/extras/d1695ad5714b1369a45f0a3ff77ffa33.avif?t=1765425123\" width=1560 height=634 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915610/extras/3aaffaa892e92a7b66f95479d8eb7b2e.avif?t=1765425123\" width=780 height=130 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple to play and easy to enjoy. Just curl up, let the treasures roll in, and see how the epic story unfolds! Each collectible you discover, from rare artifacts to cultural relics, is added to your personal cat-alog. Piece by piece, you\u2019ll build your very own Forbidden City encyclopedia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915610/extras/0ec9a1890dae6065bbe388d942de0fa6.poster.avif?t=1765425123\" width=352 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915610/extras/0ec9a1890dae6065bbe388d942de0fa6.webm?t=1765425123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915610/extras/7b9d8b15804f4a98af5b2eb080637531.avif?t=1765425123\" width=780 height=130 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The map recreates the splendid Forbidden City, shifting with real-world time and seasons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you\u2019ll stumble upon curious events. Each event is tied to your skills, the time of day, the season, or your bonds with other palace cats. These moments bring fresh quests, stories, and purr-fect rewards that keep every adventure feeling new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915610/extras/4df4244d42b2825eb8c76e98f41f33ff.avif?t=1765425123\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915610/extras/09e889d84daf043fe4f231afe1b94f0e.avif?t=1765425123\" width=780 height=130 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gift and interact to deepen your ties with fellow palace cats. Stronger bonds unlock rare skills, exclusive tales, and precious crafting blueprints. Every crafted item weaves in traditional ICH artistry, boosting your gameplay while letting you savor the charm of Chinese heritage.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3915610?t=1765425123","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3915610?t=1765425123","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915610/f8b5c1da1943f2f33ccca41cac985b2f8b8d93ef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765425123","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915610/f8b5c1da1943f2f33ccca41cac985b2f8b8d93ef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765425123","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Demo Version Notice</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you played the demo during a previous Steam Next Fest, please <strong>manually delete your old save files</strong> after updating to avoid compatibility issues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save data location: Game installation folder/save</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: The save folder is <strong>hidden by default</strong>, so please enable \u201cShow hidden files\u201d in your system settings to access it.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915610/extras/f3a6dc4c8c524f24cb3293aa24b330b7.avif?t=1765425123\" width=1232 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Meow Palace!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy, laid-back game that blends idle play, bonding, and cultural discovery. Slip into the paws of a stray kitty who\u2019s wandered into the Forbidden City. With the help of palace cats, you\u2019ll learn new tricks, collect treasures, unlock stories, and experience the whimsical life of a royal feline.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915610/extras/fab7bd287cfc19d05b92f4a1dccda04a.avif?t=1765425123\" width=780 height=130 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your tale begins the moment a little wanderer pads through the gates of the Forbidden City.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From whiskers to tail, from eye color to fur pattern, you can customize every detail to create your one-of-a-kind \u201cPalace Meow.\u201d Guided by the resident cats, you\u2019ll settle into court life, make friends, take on quests, and uncover the hidden stories tucked away in this legendary palace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915610/extras/d1695ad5714b1369a45f0a3ff77ffa33.avif?t=1765425123\" width=1560 height=634 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915610/extras/3aaffaa892e92a7b66f95479d8eb7b2e.avif?t=1765425123\" width=780 height=130 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple to play and easy to enjoy. Just curl up, let the treasures roll in, and see how the epic story unfolds! Each collectible you discover, from rare artifacts to cultural relics, is added to your personal cat-alog. Piece by piece, you\u2019ll build your very own Forbidden City encyclopedia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915610/extras/0ec9a1890dae6065bbe388d942de0fa6.poster.avif?t=1765425123\" width=352 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915610/extras/0ec9a1890dae6065bbe388d942de0fa6.webm?t=1765425123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915610/extras/7b9d8b15804f4a98af5b2eb080637531.avif?t=1765425123\" width=780 height=130 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The map recreates the splendid Forbidden City, shifting with real-world time and seasons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you\u2019ll stumble upon curious events. Each event is tied to your skills, the time of day, the season, or your bonds with other palace cats. These moments bring fresh quests, stories, and purr-fect rewards that keep every adventure feeling new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915610/extras/4df4244d42b2825eb8c76e98f41f33ff.avif?t=1765425123\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915610/extras/09e889d84daf043fe4f231afe1b94f0e.avif?t=1765425123\" width=780 height=130 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gift and interact to deepen your ties with fellow palace cats. Stronger bonds unlock rare skills, exclusive tales, and precious crafting blueprints. Every crafted item weaves in traditional ICH artistry, boosting your gameplay while letting you savor the charm of Chinese heritage.</p>","developers":["\u5bab\u55b5\u5bb6\u65cf"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"htt